  "body": "**Blocked by:** #134\n\n## Context\n\nProject agents need configuration and recent outcomes without cross-project access or transcript inflation.\n\n## Task\n\nRegister core AgentTools `heartbeat.list` and `heartbeat.history({heartbeatId,limit})` through ModuleRegistry. Derive the project exclusively from the persisted current `agent_run.project_item_id`; neither schema accepts a project id. List returns full rule, assignment/purpose, enabled state, and `last_fired_at` for both agent and deterministic heartbeats. Add nullable `agent_runs.heartbeat_id` and populate it for every agent run started by a scheduled, event, or later manual heartbeat. History validates ownership and returns last N (default 10, bounded maximum) status/timestamps/result records, never event transcripts. Deterministic actions that start no agent have no history rows.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Two tools, migration/write propagation, scoping, bounds, and errors.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- `heartbeat.inspect`, deterministic-action log table, and manual trigger.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Cross-project ids are indistinguishable from unknown ids.\n- Event-started agent runs appear in history.\n- Results are bounded and contain no transcript.\n",
